OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies as kitchen blaze engulfs
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has died in a fire
OL,7,Fwhich police believe started in the
OL,8,Fkitchen of a house.
OL,10,FThe blaze was spotted at the property
OL,11,Fon Park Road in the village of Witton
OL,12,FPark, near Bishop Auckland in County
OL,13,FDurham, at 08:15 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FFirefighters entered the building and
OL,16,Fpulled the man out but, despite efforts
OL,17,Fto save his life, he was pronounced
OL,18,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
